<title>USA: Vertical group holds 8.2 pct VitalCom stake.</title>
<headline>Vertical group holds 8.2 pct VitalCom stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Vertical Fund Associates L.P., of Summit, N.J., said Monday it holds an 8.2 percent stake or 645,082 common shares in VitalCom Inc, of Tustin, Calif.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its stake includes 363,200 shares it bought between August 27 and September 17 for $3.97 to $7.12 a share.</p>
<p>The group said it holds the stake for investment.</p>
